      "content": "omg that sounds terrifying... i'm actually really panicking now. do you think there's any chance it's just a bad cramp from sitting so long? like, could i just take some ibuprofen and try to rest for a few hours to see if it goes away before i commit to a whole hospital trip? i'm really not a fan of doctors.",
